.TH TERRYDAVIS 8 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "System Daemons"
.SH NAME
terrydavis \- ALI quality-of-life daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B terrydavis
.RI [ \-\-once | \-\-welcome ]
