Janitor, town crier (Odysseus warnings, updates, Oracle
verdicts), USB announcer, game mode, WiFi watchdog, night
light, download sorter, coffee mode, crash catcher, battery
brain, wallpaper rotation, shrine keeper, welcome-back ping.
